<article class="env-lemma" id="060M">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/060M">Lemma <span data-tag="060M">28.22.3</span>.</a> Let $f : X \to Y$ be a morphism of schemes. Let $\mathcal{G}$ be a quasi-coherent $\mathcal{O}_ Y$-module. If $\mathcal{G}$ is locally projective on $Y$, then $f^*\mathcal{G}$ is locally projective on $X$. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Follows from Algebra, Lemma <a href="/tag/05A3" data-tag="05A3">10.94.1</a> and Lemma <a href="/tag/05JQ" data-tag="05JQ">28.22.2</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>